  "body": "Tucked away from the road this lovely cedar townhouse is in an enviable location just a short level stroll from shops, restaurants, beach and the iconic Mission Bay Fountain. \r\n\r\nBuilt in the 1980s and meticulously maintained, this hidden two-level gem offers 90m² of thoughtfully designed space. Downstairs features open plan living, kitchen and dining flowing easily to a private courtyard - perfect for alfresco dining, children’s play or tranquil mornings with a coffee and a good book. Upstairs: family bathroom, separate toilet and three bedrooms - the third smaller one could also be configured as a study or home office. A separate laundry, all the mod cons, heat pump, single carport and off-street parking for two cars all add to this property's comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nSet on a 189m² site in the afore-mentioned desirable location - and in zone for Selwyn College and Kohimarama School. The vibrant Mission Bay lifestyle is a flat walk and you could be in by Christmas. Give yourself the best present ever! Call me!\r\n\r\nPlease visit www.barfoot.co.nz/940710 and scroll down to download or view: Title; LIM (where available); Particulars and Conditions of Sale by Auction (where applicable); and other informative documents",
